<title>CANADA: G.T.C. Transcontinental gets C$80 mln deal.</title>
<headline>G.T.C. Transcontinental gets C$80 mln deal.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>G.T.C. Transcontinental Group Ltd said its subsidiary Transcontinental Printing received a C$80 million contract to print most telephone directories for Bell Canada, a unit of BCE Inc.</p>
<p>The contract starts January 1997, it said.</p>
<p>Transcontinental Printing had revenues of C$747.4 million in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
